{"page":247,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:96","surah":12,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ أَن جَآءَ ٱلْبَشِيرُ أَلْقَىٰهُ عَلَىٰ وَجْهِهِۦ فَٱرْتَدَّ بَصِيرًا ۖ قَالَ أَلَمْ أَقُل لَّكُمْ إِنِّىٓ أَعْلَمُ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then, when the bearer of good news came and placed the shirt on to Jacob’s face, his eyesight returned and he said, ‘Did I not tell you that I have knowledge from God that you do not have?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّآ","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"arrived","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَشِيرُ","en_gloss":"the bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"l-bashīru","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَلْقَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"he cast it","transliteration":"alqāhu","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَجْهِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his face","transliteration":"wajhihi","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱرْتَدَّ","en_gloss":"then returned (his) sight","transliteration":"fa-ir'tadda","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَصِيرًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"then returned (his) sight","transliteration":"baṣīran","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَقُل","en_gloss":"I say","transliteration":"aqul","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"[I] know","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"12:96"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key