","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:100"}]},{"verse_key":"12:101","surah":12,"ayah":101,"ar_uthmani":"۞ رَبِّ قَدْ ءَاتَيْتَنِى مِنَ ٱلْمُلْكِ وَعَلَّمْتَنِى مِن تَأْوِيلِ ٱلْأَحَادِيثِ ۚ فَاطِرَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ أَنتَ وَلِىِّۦ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ تَوَفَّنِى مُسْلِمًا وَأَلْحِقْنِى بِٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My Lord! You have given me authority; You have taught me something about the interpretation of dreams; Creator of the heavens and the earth, You are my protector in this world and in the Hereafter. Let me die in true devotion to You. Join me with the righteous.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاتَيْتَنِى","en_gloss":"you have given me","transliteration":"ātaytanī","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُلْكِ","en_gloss":"the sovereignty","transliteration":"l-mul'ki","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعَلَّمْتَنِى","en_gloss":"and taught me","transliteration":"waʿallamtanī","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَأْوِيلِ","en_gloss":"the interpretation","transliteration":"tawīli","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَحَادِيثِ ۚ","en_gloss":"of the events","transliteration":"l-aḥādīthi","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَاطِرَ","en_gloss":"Creator","transliteration":"fāṭira","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"12:101"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلِىِّۦ","en_gloss":"(are) my Protector","transliterati